cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Imaginary quadratic fields with class group of exponent 7"
abstract: >-
  Assuming GRH for the quadratic Dirichlet L-functions of prime conductor, no
  fundamental discriminant D with 3.1e20 <= |D| <= 1e32 has class group of
  exponent 7. With Elsenhans-Kluners-Nicolae and Aiken-Ross-Shvydkoy-Xue this
  shows that under ERH there are exactly 33 imaginary quadratic fields and 40
  imaginary quadratic orders with class group of exponent 7.
authors:
